Date: Wed, 1 Jul 2026 13:23:29 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Neko LineageOS: Add Broker Compatibility API signature spoof
 part [WIP]

In some cases, Push Provider or push component needs to be patched (e.g. HMS Core) inorder to work wothout XPosed.
This feature offered by Broker Compatibility API will enable application get the expected signature of modified push
component when the feature is enabled and user permitted

Change-Id: I65c55745e767b466a0a1cd2988cc9e1e025998ae
